# The composer's wrap, taken at 40x120 and 24x80: a word wider than a row
# after `look`; words, one of them wider than an 80-column row; a badge and a
# pasted-text block just before the margin (at 71 cells, then after 111); a
# row filled exactly, then one past it with the caret stepped back onto the
# boundary; a paste with tabs in it; and Up from under a wide glyph, which
# lands in front of it. `cursor` says where the caret is.
work image-ws
wait 10
type look
key Space
type xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
wait 0.5
snap long-word
cursor long-word
key C-u
type alpha yyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyy omega and the rest of it
wait 0.5
snap words
cursor words
key C-u
type aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
key Space
paste shot.png
wait 1.5
snap badge-71
cursor badge-71
key C-u
type aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
key Space
paste shot.png
wait 1.5
snap badge-111
cursor badge-111
key C-u
type aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
key Space
pastex 1001
wait 3
snap block-71
cursor block-71
key C-u
type aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa
key Space
pastex 1001
wait 3
snap block-111
cursor block-111
key C-u
type bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
wait 0.5
snap full-78
cursor full-78
type bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb
wait 0.5
snap full-118
cursor full-118
type b
key Left
wait 0.5
snap boundary
cursor boundary
key End
key C-u
paste a\tbb\tccc\td
wait 1
snap tabs
cursor tabs
key C-u
type ab界cd
key C-j
type xyz
key Up
wait 0.5
snap up-wide
cursor up-wide
